This is the bug or unintended behavior that I found.

I also wondered what these lines are:

#>             [,1]       [,2]        [,3]       [,4]       [,5]
#> [1,]  0.16314255  0.2133761 -0.07923048  0.3685547  0.3416982
#> [2,]  0.21337609  0.2825516 -0.10067745  0.4582031  0.4781250
