Hi Terrance,

I found this conversation very useful, I am currently testing the effects of three intervention conditions on different pro-environmental behaviours over time. I am using the following code to test my unconditional growth model:

model <- 'i =~ 1*Food_waste + 1*Food_waste_2 + 1*Food_waste_3
s =~ 0*Food_waste + 1*Food_waste_2 + 2*Food_waste_3'

