> > > F2=~0.330*I4+0.686*I5+0.350*I6
> > >
> > > #General Factor
> > > G=~0.300*I1+.671*I2+.320*I3+.525*I4+.340*I5+.357*I6
> > >
> > > #Factor correlation
> > > F1~~0*F2+0*G
> > > F2~~0*G
> > >
> > > #thresholds
> > > I6|(-0.130)*t1+(-0.009)*t2+0.292*t3+0.910*t4
> > > I5|(-1.176)*t1+(-0.640)*t2+0.657*t3+1.613*t4
